# ####################################################################################
# LABEL DUMP
# ####################################################################################
# Target an item and see exactly what getlabel returns for it.
#
# Why this exists
#   Outlands sends an item label as several messages in a row, a name line and then one
#   line per property. Razor getlabel joins them with a space, so a single variable can
#   hold both "bronze mastery chain link" and its property text.
#   This tool shows the joined result so you can copy the exact substring to match on,
#   including its capitalisation. The in operator is case sensitive, and item names come
#   through lowercase while property lines look title cased, so guessing is unreliable.
#
# Use
#   Run it, target the item, then read the overhead. The same text also goes to the
#   journal so you can scroll back and copy it.
# ####################################################################################

clearsysmsg
clearall
clearignore

overhead "Target an item to read its label:" 55
@setvar! var__label_target
wait 1000

if not varexist var__label_target
    overhead "Nothing selected." 33
    stop
endif

getlabel var__label_target label__dump

overhead "{{label__dump}}" 88
sysmsg "{{label__dump}}" 88
